    "features": "<p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Armor Crush, Drag Underwater (2 SP), Grapple, Lightning Attack, Strangle</p><p><strong>Chromatophores:</strong> Hydrapods communicate through splashes of color across their flesh in a rudimentary language slightly more advanced than an Earth octopus.</p><p><strong>Drag Underwater (2 Sp):</strong> If the hydrapod succeeds on an opposed Fighting (Grappling) test, it can perform this stunt to submerge the target and attempt to drown them.</p><p><strong>Water Breathing:</strong> Hydrapods can spend days underwater without needing to surface.</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Pinpoint Accuracy, Quick Reflexes</p><p><strong>Armor + Toughness:</strong> 5</p>",
